        { "host": "B", "text": "It lets you check that the answer you got actually came from the model the provider committed to. It uses zero-knowledge proofs. Anthropic tested it on Llama 4 Maverick, a 400 billion parameter model, and reports proofs generated at 110 tokens per second on a single H100." },
