      "lines": [
        { "host": "A", "text": "CNBC reported the neoclouds CoreWeave and Iren down 2.6% and 2.8% in Wednesday premarket trading, Nebius relatively flat, and Oracle down 1.3%. SpaceX fell 3.8% and Tesla 3.5%." },
