        { "host": "B", "text": "It wasn't only Texas. CNBC reports Democrats won or retained governorships in Georgia, Pennsylvania and Ohio, which Wells Fargo puts at 7%, 5% and 5% of planned US data centre gigawatts." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "CNBC quotes a Wells Fargo strategist warning before the vote that a Democratic win in Texas could be a left-tail event for the AI trade. And Musk posted in the early hours that data centers in space are looking pretty appealing right now." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "These are premarket moves, not closing prices. And the restrictions investors are pricing in are campaign positions, not enacted policy." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "outro",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "A", "text": "That's The AI Edge for today. The full edition, with a link to every source behind what you've just heard, is on the site." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Our voices are AI-generated." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Listen in tomorrow for the next edition. Thanks for being with us." }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

