        { "host": "A", "text": "US voters used Tuesday's midterm elections to curb the AI build-out, and Ballotpedia counted 41 local ballot measures on data centre policy across 10 states." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "NBC's exit poll found that 57% of voters said AI will do more to hurt society than help, and 76% said they opposed building data centres in their communities." },
