        { "host": "B", "text": "Google also put out research the same day. A randomised trial with more than 300 University of Tokyo students, each given half a day to study a statistics lesson. Students using standard web tools improved by 5.3 percentage points. Students with Guided Learning in the Gemini app improved by 8.1." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "With the caveat of who ran it. Google ran the trial, and the figures are not independently verified. The post gives no effect size, no confidence interval and no significance test. It also gives no date for the default change, saying only that Google will share more specifics in the coming months." }
