      "In written answers to MediaNama published on 4 November, CERT-In director general Dr Sanjay Bahl says an agent that misuses credentials or acts beyond its scope is a cybersecurity incident, citing the April 2022 Directions, which cover incidents affecting AI and machine learning systems. Reports are due within six hours, and \"Any entity which notices the incident shall report to CERT-In\" — the agent's developer, the deploying organisation or the platform it acted on.",
